  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきに　おそわれると　ふとい　とげをどうたいから　つきだして　はんげき。みをきる　かくごの　きけんな　わざ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "적에게 공격을 받으면 몸에서 굵은 가시를 내지르며 반격한다. 몸이 끊어질 각오가 필요한 위험한 기술이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一旦遭到敵人襲擊，就會從胴體伸出粗壯的刺來反擊。是需有覺悟承受劇痛的危險招式。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand on l’attaque, il riposte en faisant sortir de grosses épines de son tronc, une dangereuse technique qui montre qu’il est prêt à tout risquer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird Suelord angegriffen, wehrt es sich, indem es dicke Stacheln ausfährt. Setzt es diese riskante Attacke ein, ist es bereit, aufs Ganze zu gehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se siente amenazado, repele al enemigo con sus gruesas púas retráctiles. Esta técnica tan peligrosa es un arma de doble filo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando si trova sotto attacco, controbatte sfoderando le spesse spine retrattili, mettendo così a repentaglio anche se stesso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When attacked, this Pokémon will retaliate by sticking thick spines out from its body. It’s a risky move that puts everything on the line.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵に　襲われると　太い　棘を胴体から　突き出して　反撃。身を切る　覚悟の　危険な　技。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一旦遭到敌人袭击，就会从躯体伸出粗粗的刺来反击。此招式很危险，需有切断身体的觉悟。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se siente amenazado, repele al enemigo con sus gruesas púas retráctiles. Esta técnica tan peligrosa es un arma de doble filo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いけや　ぬまの　みなそこで　くらす。せなかに　ウパーを　のせて　およぎたいがんまで　はこんであげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "연못이나 늪의 밑바닥에서 산다. 등에 우파를 태우고 헤엄치며 건너편까지 옮겨다 준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在池塘和沼澤底部。會讓烏波坐在自己背上，然後游泳送到對岸去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon vit au fond des étangs et des marais. Il porte des Axoloto sur son dos et nage jusqu’à la rive opposée pour les aider à traverser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt auf dem Grund von Teichen und Sümpfen. Man kann beobachten, wie es Felino auf seinem Rücken von einem Ufer zum anderen befördert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en el fondo de los estanques y pantanos. Nada con Wooper sobre el lomo para ayudarlos a cruzar de una orilla a otra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive sui fondali degli stagni e delle paludi. Si carica i Wooper sulla schiena e li traghetta da una sponda all’altra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives at the bottom of ponds and swamps. It will carry Wooper on its back and ferry them across water from one shore to the other.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "池や　沼の　水底で　暮らす。背中に　ウパーを　乗せて　泳ぎ対岸まで　運んであげる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栖息在池塘或沼泽的底部。会让乌波坐在自己背上，然后游着泳把它送到对岸去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
